          "code": "from functools import *\n\n@lru_cache(None)\ndef f(n):\n    if n > 30:\n        return f(n-6) + 2048\n    else:\n        return 3 * (g(n-5) + 13)\n\n@lru_cache(None)\ndef g(n):\n    if n >= 221337:\n        return 2*n + 50\n    else:\n        return g(n+11) - 48\n\nfor i in reversed(range(301210)):\n    g(i)\nfor i in range(55000):\n    f(i)\n\nprint(f(5078))",
